No BBT source file was copied. The code here is original TypeScript written against BBT's documented behaviour
and its source (read, never executed). What was taken over as data or specification, with attribution here:

  - the formula language (function and filter names, parameters, defaults, alternatives, conditions),
    the default skip-word list and unsafe-character list (formula.ts, text.ts, settings.ts);
  - the field order, entry-type maps and case-protection rules of the BibTeX / BibLaTeX exporters (export/*);
  - the shapes of the CAYW, pull-export and JSON-RPC endpoints (cite.ts, rpc.ts, http.ts).

Unicode-to-LaTeX tables are small, hand-written subsets (export/latex.ts); BBT uses the unicode2latex package.
Not ported: eta templates, Juris-M fields, jieba/kuromoji/pinyin transliteration, TeXstudio push, the BetterBibTeX JSON
(jzon) debug format, group libraries.
